Large-Eddy Simulation of Time Evolution and Instability


of Highly Underexpanded Sonic Jets


Xiaopeng Li,
∗
 
Wei Yao,
†
 
and Xuejun Fan
‡


Chinese Academy of Sciences, 100190 Beijing, People
’
